      "content": "rebuilding feels like such a lie though. you can't just rebuild a person when the very thing that made them a person is dead. the intellect, the drive, the reason people even cared... it's not a phase. it's just over. i look in the mirror and there's nothing there to work with. it's just a hollow shell.",
